WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.280
I'm Kellen Reeves with the
Illinois Black Alliance Chamber of Commerce.

00:04.280 --> 00:08.280
This was really an excellent event,
just showing the various different ways

00:08.280 --> 00:13.120
in which Chicago and Ghana can come together
and connect to help grow business,

00:13.120 --> 00:17.000
not only in the States,
but also there in Ghana.

00:17.000 --> 00:20.880
As the Black Chamber of Commerce, we're really
excited about the opportunities

00:20.880 --> 00:24.080
that will present themselves,
as we want to connect

00:24.080 --> 00:27.760
Black businesses, Black business owners,
and entrepreneurs

00:27.760 --> 00:31.000
with opportunities to grow their business
and thus benefit our communities,

00:31.000 --> 00:34.520
whether that's here at home
in Chicago, Illinois, or abroad in Ghana,

00:34.520 --> 00:37.040
as we continue to connect the diaspora.

00:37.040 --> 00:39.520
So really a great event,
glad to be here.
